    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\n_No response_\n\n### Feature Description\n\nCurrently `globalAutoAcceptDir` points to `QStandardPaths::HomeLocation`.\n\nhttps://github.com/TokTok/qTox/blob/ceff71f0e37ca82233d23802a6cd4f55ff2c0936/src/persistence/settings.cpp#L175-L177\n\nIt's better to use the \"Download\" path, as provided by `QStandardPaths::DownloadLocation` (https://stackoverflow.com/questions/3571972).\n\n### Contribution\n\n- [x] I would like to contribute to this feature",
